---
import { path } from '../config/site';
interface Props { href: string; }
const { href } = Astro.props;
const targetHref = path(href);
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><meta http-equiv="refresh" content={`0;url=${targetHref}`} /><title>正在跳转</title></head><body><main><p>此链接已迁移到多语言站点。<a href={targetHref}>前往中文页面</a></p></main></body></html>
